{"id":"game-12-equipment-and-items","group":"game","groupLabel":"Game Design","number":"12","title":"Equipment and Items","summary":"Defines weapons, equipment, consumables, rarity, acquisition, progression and inventory rules.","sourceFile":"Game Design/12 - Equipment and Items.docx","meta":{"status":"DRAFT","version":"0.15.7","owner":"J. Crow","last_updated":"08/20/2026"},"headings":[{"level":1,"text":"1. Item Categories"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":2,"text":"Weapons"},{"level":1,"text":"Equipment"},{"level":3,"text":"Artifacts"},{"level":3,"text":"Last Wills"},{"level":1,"text":"Consumables"},{"level":3,"text":"Cooking"},{"level":3,"text":"Alchemy"},{"level":1,"text":"Materials"},{"level":3,"text":"Development"},{"level":3,"text":"Regional"},{"level":3,"text":"Enemies"},{"level":3,"text":"Crafting"},{"level":3,"text":"Special"},{"level":1,"text":"Quest Items"},{"level":3,"text":"Key Items"},{"level":1,"text":"Relics and Treasures"},{"level":1,"text":"2. Weapon Rules"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":2,"text":"Compatibility"},{"level":1,"text":"Exceptions"},{"level":1,"text":"Weapon statistics"},{"level":3,"text":"Main statistic"},{"level":3,"text":"Secondary statistic"},{"level":3,"text":"Passive"},{"level":1,"text":"Conceptual example"},{"level":3,"text":"5★ Scythe"},{"level":1,"text":"Signature Weapons"},{"level":3,"text":"Signature Weapon"},{"level":1,"text":"Weapon rarities"},{"level":3,"text":"3★"},{"level":3,"text":"4★"},{"level":3,"text":"5★"},{"level":1,"text":"Differences between rarities"},{"level":1,"text":"3. Equipment Slots"},{"level":1,"text":"Equipment structure"},{"level":3,"text":"1 Weapon Slot"},{"level":3,"text":"5 Artifact Slots"},{"level":3,"text":"Up to 2 Last Will Slots"},{"level":1,"text":"Artifact Slots"},{"level":3,"text":"Slot I"},{"level":3,"text":"Slot II"},{"level":3,"text":"Slot III"},{"level":3,"text":"Slot IV"},{"level":3,"text":"Slot V"},{"level":1,"text":"Artifact statistics"},{"level":3,"text":"Main Stat"},{"level":3,"text":"Secondary Stats"},{"level":3,"text":"Set Identity"},{"level":1,"text":"Sets"},{"level":3,"text":"2-Piece Bonus"},{"level":3,"text":"4-Piece Bonus"},{"level":1,"text":"Last Wills"},{"level":3,"text":"Maximum 2 Slots"},{"level":1,"text":"Fundamental difference"},{"level":3,"text":"Artifacts"},{"level":3,"text":"Last Wills"},{"level":1,"text":"4. Upgrade System"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Weapons"},{"level":2,"text":"Level"},{"level":2,"text":"Evolution"},{"level":2,"text":"Refinement"},{"level":1,"text":"Artifacts"},{"level":2,"text":"Level"},{"level":1,"text":"Cap"},{"level":1,"text":"Sacrifice Mechanism"},{"level":1,"text":"5. Acquisition"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Exploration"},{"level":1,"text":"Crafting"},{"level":3,"text":"Blacksmithing"},{"level":1,"text":"Bosses"},{"level":3,"text":"Evolution Bosses"},{"level":3,"text":"Weekly Bosses"},{"level":1,"text":"Dungeons"},{"level":1,"text":"Shops"},{"level":1,"text":"Events"},{"level":1,"text":"Gacha"},{"level":3,"text":"4★ and 5★ Weapons"},{"level":1,"text":"Last Wills"},{"level":1,"text":"Acquisition map"},{"level":1,"text":"6. Inventory UX Requirements"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Main categories"},{"level":3,"text":"Weapons"},{"level":3,"text":"Artifacts"},{"level":3,"text":"Last Wills"},{"level":3,"text":"Consumables"},{"level":3,"text":"Materials"},{"level":3,"text":"Quest Items"},{"level":3,"text":"Relics"},{"level":1,"text":"Filters"},{"level":2,"text":"Weapons"},{"level":2,"text":"Artifacts"},{"level":3,"text":"Search by desired stat"},{"level":1,"text":"Sorting"},{"level":1,"text":"Locking"},{"level":3,"text":"Lock"},{"level":1,"text":"Favorites"},{"level":3,"text":"Favorite"},{"level":1,"text":"Comparison"},{"level":1,"text":"Equipment by character"},{"level":1,"text":"Loadouts"},{"level":3,"text":"Equipment Presets"},{"level":1,"text":"Shared equipment"},{"level":1,"text":"Dismantling"},{"level":1,"text":"Sacrifice"},{"level":3,"text":"Dismantle"},{"level":3,"text":"Sacrifice"},{"level":1,"text":"Multiple selection"},{"level":1,"text":"Protection"},{"level":3,"text":"Mandatory confirmation."},{"level":1,"text":"Capacity"},{"level":1,"text":"Recommended / Auto Equip"},{"level":3,"text":"Recommended Build"},{"level":1,"text":"Salvage Preview"}],"blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SYMPHONIA IUSTITIAE"},{"type":"title","text":"12 - Equipment and Items"},{"type":"p","text":"Weapons, Items, Relics, and Consumables"},{"type":"table","table":0},{"type":"h1","text":"1. Item Categories"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"The items in Symphony of Justice should be classified according to their function to prevent inventory, progression, and economy systems from mixing elements that serve completely different purposes."},{"type":"p","text":"The main classification is proposed as:"},{"type":"p","text":"WEAPONS → EQUIPMENT → CONSUMABLES → MATERIALS → KEY ITEMS → RELICS / TREASURES"},{"type":"h2","text":"Weapons"},{"type":"p","text":"Weapons determine an important part of:"},{"type":"p","text":"normal attacks;"},{"type":"p","text":"combat rhythm;"},{"type":"p","text":"statistics;"},{"type":"p","text":"animations;"},{"type":"p","text":"passives;"},{"type":"p","text":"visual identity."},{"type":"p","text":"The current documentation includes six official families:"},{"type":"p","text":"Sword"},{"type":"p","text":"Greatsword"},{"type":"p","text":"Spear"},{"type":"p","text":"Bow"},{"type":"p","text":"Spellbook"},{"type":"p","text":"Scythe"},{"type":"p","text":"These categories are considered a strong historical foundation. A weapon does not automatically determine a role."},{"type":"p","text":"For example, the documents already show characters with Shields functioning as Guardians, but also characters with Swords performing medical or support roles, and Spellbook users with completely different responsibilities."},{"type":"h1","text":"Equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"Equipment modifies statistics and builds without replacing the character's kit."},{"type":"p","text":"It is initially divided into two families:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Artifacts"},{"type":"p","text":"Standard equipment system. The original documentation establishes:"},{"type":"p","text":"sets;"},{"type":"p","text":"five pieces;"},{"type":"p","text":"rarities from 1★ to 5★;"},{"type":"p","text":"statistics;"},{"type":"p","text":"Sacrifice Mechanism."},{"type":"h3","text":"Last Wills"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced equipment linked to:"},{"type":"p","text":"deities;"},{"type":"p","text":"ideologies;"},{"type":"p","text":"historical figures;"},{"type":"p","text":"events;"},{"type":"p","text":"Bosses."},{"type":"p","text":"It may provide effects that are:"},{"type":"p","text":"offensive;"},{"type":"p","text":"defensive;"},{"type":"p","text":"support-oriented;"},{"type":"p","text":"specialized."},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documentation proposes that their sets require only one or two pieces, reducing the amount needed compared with conventional equipment. This allows Last Wills to function as an additional specialization layer without directly replacing Artifacts."},{"type":"h1","text":"Consumables"},{"type":"p","text":"Items that disappear when used. They may come primarily from:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Cooking"},{"type":"p","text":"healing;"},{"type":"p","text":"regeneration;"},{"type":"p","text":"buffs;"},{"type":"p","text":"resistance;"},{"type":"p","text":"exploration preparation."},{"type":"h3","text":"Alchemy"},{"type":"p","text":"potions;"},{"type":"p","text":"antidotes;"},{"type":"p","text":"resistances;"},{"type":"p","text":"elemental utilities;"},{"type":"p","text":"exploration aids."},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documents already conceive Cooking and Alchemy as complementary crafting and preparation systems."},{"type":"h1","text":"Materials"},{"type":"p","text":"These are resources intended for progression or crafting. They may be divided into:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"character EXP;"},{"type":"p","text":"weapon EXP;"},{"type":"p","text":"talent materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"Evolution."},{"type":"h3","text":"Regional"},{"type":"p","text":"plants;"},{"type":"p","text":"minerals;"},{"type":"p","text":"creatures;"},{"type":"p","text":"national drops."},{"type":"h3","text":"Enemies"},{"type":"p","text":"common drops;"},{"type":"p","text":"elites;"},{"type":"p","text":"Bosses."},{"type":"h3","text":"Crafting"},{"type":"p","text":"Blacksmithing;"},{"type":"p","text":"Cooking;"},{"type":"p","text":"Alchemy."},{"type":"h3","text":"Special"},{"type":"p","text":"Bosses;"},{"type":"p","text":"Dungeons;"},{"type":"p","text":"events."},{"type":"p","text":"Materials should clearly indicate: Where they are obtained + what they are used for."},{"type":"h1","text":"Quest Items"},{"type":"p","text":"Also known as:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Key Items"},{"type":"p","text":"They are not part of the conventional economy. They include:"},{"type":"p","text":"documents;"},{"type":"p","text":"keys;"},{"type":"p","text":"evidence;"},{"type":"p","text":"letters;"},{"type":"p","text":"narrative items;"},{"type":"p","text":"mechanisms;"},{"type":"p","text":"temporary quest artifacts."},{"type":"p","text":"They should not be able to:"},{"type":"p","text":"be sold;"},{"type":"p","text":"be sacrificed;"},{"type":"p","text":"be used accidentally;"},{"type":"p","text":"occupy limited inventory space."},{"type":"p","text":"When they are no longer needed, they may:"},{"type":"p","text":"remain archived in the Codex;"},{"type":"p","text":"become a keepsake;"},{"type":"p","text":"disappear through the narrative."},{"type":"h1","text":"Relics and Treasures"},{"type":"p","text":"They represent special items obtained through:"},{"type":"p","text":"exploration;"},{"type":"p","text":"secrets;"},{"type":"p","text":"Dungeons;"},{"type":"p","text":"ruins;"},{"type":"p","text":"events."},{"type":"p","text":"The original documentation even has a specific section devoted to Treasures and national weapons, allowing them to be used as part of the worldbuilding as well."},{"type":"p","text":"Not all relics need to be equippable."},{"type":"p","text":"They may function as:"},{"type":"p","text":"collectibles;"},{"type":"p","text":"lore;"},{"type":"p","text":"decoration;"},{"type":"p","text":"achievement;"},{"type":"p","text":"historical item;"},{"type":"p","text":"quest access;"},{"type":"p","text":"exceptional crafting material."},{"type":"h1","text":"2. Weapon Rules"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Each character has a compatible weapon family defined in their gameplay sheet. The historical documentation already assigns specific weapons to numerous characters."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Juro → Scythe;"},{"type":"p","text":"Hizuka → Sword;"},{"type":"p","text":"Serverus → Bow;"},{"type":"p","text":"Aligura → Spellbook;"},{"type":"p","text":"Haruko → Spear;"},{"type":"p","text":"Josuke → Greatsword."},{"type":"h2","text":"Compatibility"},{"type":"p","text":"As an initial rule: Each character equips a single weapon family."},{"type":"p","text":"This facilitates:"},{"type":"p","text":"animation;"},{"type":"p","text":"rigging;"},{"type":"p","text":"identity;"},{"type":"p","text":"balance;"},{"type":"p","text":"readability."},{"type":"p","text":"I would not allow every character to equip every weapon."},{"type":"h1","text":"Exceptions"},{"type":"p","text":"Some future characters might use:"},{"type":"p","text":"a hybrid weapon;"},{"type":"p","text":"a transformation;"},{"type":"p","text":"a summoned weapon;"},{"type":"p","text":"a second stance."},{"type":"p","text":"But it must be a feature of their kit, not a general rule."},{"type":"h1","text":"Weapon statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Each weapon may have:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Main statistic"},{"type":"p","text":"Usually:"},{"type":"p","text":"ATK;"},{"type":"p","text":"HP;"},{"type":"p","text":"DEF;"},{"type":"p","text":"depending on the design."},{"type":"h3","text":"Secondary statistic"},{"type":"p","text":"It may include:"},{"type":"p","text":"Critical Rate;"},{"type":"p","text":"Critical Damage;"},{"type":"p","text":"Energy Recharge;"},{"type":"p","text":"Alchemy;"},{"type":"p","text":"Elemental Damage;"},{"type":"p","text":"HP%;"},{"type":"p","text":"DEF%;"},{"type":"p","text":"ATK%."},{"type":"h3","text":"Passive"},{"type":"p","text":"A rule characteristic of that weapon."},{"type":"h1","text":"Conceptual example"},{"type":"h3","text":"5★ Scythe"},{"type":"p","text":"Base ATK: high"},{"type":"p","text":"Secondary: Critical Damage"},{"type":"p","text":"Passive: When HP is consumed through a Skill, the damage of the next ability is temporarily increased."},{"type":"p","text":"It could work very well with certain characters, but it should also remain useful for other Scythe users."},{"type":"h1","text":"Signature Weapons"},{"type":"p","text":"A character may have a:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Signature Weapon"},{"type":"p","text":"designed to complement their kit. However, the character must be fully functional without it."},{"type":"p","text":"The Signature should:"},{"type":"p","text":"specialize;"},{"type":"p","text":"optimize;"},{"type":"p","text":"reinforce the fantasy;"},{"type":"p","text":"not:"},{"type":"p","text":"repair an incomplete kit."},{"type":"p","text":"This is especially important because weapons may be part of the Gacha system."},{"type":"h1","text":"Weapon rarities"},{"type":"p","text":"I propose retaining:"},{"type":"h3","text":"3★"},{"type":"p","text":"Initial and accessible weapons."},{"type":"h3","text":"4★"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialized and fully competitive weapons."},{"type":"h3","text":"5★"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced weapons, Signature Weapons, or featured content."},{"type":"p","text":"This structure also fits the historical Sacrifice Mechanism, in which Artifacts used rarities from 3★ to 5★."},{"type":"h1","text":"Differences between rarities"},{"type":"p","text":"They should not be based exclusively on statistics."},{"type":"p","text":"They may increase:"},{"type":"p","text":"passive quality;"},{"type":"p","text":"build possibilities;"},{"type":"p","text":"visual budget;"},{"type":"p","text":"specialization."},{"type":"p","text":"A good 4★ weapon should be able to outperform a 5★ weapon in a build for which it was specifically designed."},{"type":"h1","text":"3. Equipment Slots"},{"type":"p","text":"Here we must clearly distinguish between what is documented and what is proposed. The documentation establishes that an Artifact set consists of five items, but it does not provide definitive names for those positions."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, I propose:"},{"type":"h1","text":"Equipment structure"},{"type":"h3","text":"1 Weapon Slot"},{"type":"h3","text":"5 Artifact Slots"},{"type":"h3","text":"Up to 2 Last Will Slots"},{"type":"p","text":"This gives a maximum structure of:"},{"type":"p","text":"1 weapon + 5 Artifacts + 2 Last Wills"},{"type":"p","text":"but the Last Will slots could unlock later in progression."},{"type":"h1","text":"Artifact Slots"},{"type":"p","text":"The definitive names should be established later within the lore. For now, we can use functional identifiers:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Slot I"},{"type":"h3","text":"Slot II"},{"type":"h3","text":"Slot III"},{"type":"h3","text":"Slot IV"},{"type":"h3","text":"Slot V"},{"type":"p","text":"I would avoid inventing names such as “Crown,” “Clock,” or “Chalice” until we decide what they actually represent within Symphony of Justice."},{"type":"h1","text":"Artifact statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Each Artifact may have:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Main Stat"},{"type":"p","text":"One main statistic."},{"type":"h3","text":"Secondary Stats"},{"type":"p","text":"Several secondary statistics."},{"type":"h3","text":"Set Identity"},{"type":"p","text":"It belongs to a set."},{"type":"h1","text":"Sets"},{"type":"p","text":"The original documentation already assumes that Artifacts belong to specific sets, because the Sacrifice Mechanism requires the sacrificed material to match the set, piece, and rarity."},{"type":"p","text":"We can structure them as:"},{"type":"h3","text":"2-Piece Bonus"},{"type":"p","text":"Accessible bonus."},{"type":"h3","text":"4-Piece Bonus"},{"type":"p","text":"Main mechanic."},{"type":"p","text":"The fifth slot provides statistical freedom."},{"type":"p","text":"This allows:"},{"type":"p","text":"4 + 1"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"p","text":"2 + 2 + 1"},{"type":"p","text":"and creates more build options."},{"type":"h1","text":"Last Wills"},{"type":"p","text":"I propose that they have:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Maximum 2 Slots"},{"type":"p","text":"because the documentation already conceives them through small sets of one or two pieces. Their effects should be more qualitative. Historical name examples include:"},{"type":"p","text":"The Sin of Greed;"},{"type":"p","text":"King Shadow;"},{"type":"p","text":"The Martyrs;"},{"type":"p","text":"The Will of the Shadows;"},{"type":"p","text":"The Ministry's Last Wish."},{"type":"h1","text":"Fundamental difference"},{"type":"h3","text":"Artifacts"},{"type":"p","text":"They build statistics and builds."},{"type":"h3","text":"Last Wills"},{"type":"p","text":"They add thematic specialization or advanced mechanics."},{"type":"p","text":"If both layers do exactly the same thing, one of them is unnecessary."},{"type":"h1","text":"4. Upgrade System"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"The upgrade system should allow equipment to be developed without creating five refinement systems on top of five other refinement systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The proposed progression will be:"},{"type":"p","text":"OBTAIN → EVALUATE → UPGRADE → SPECIALIZE → KEEP / SACRIFICE"},{"type":"h1","text":"Weapons"},{"type":"h2","text":"Level"},{"type":"p","text":"Weapons gain EXP through:"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"surplus weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"Blacksmithing;"},{"type":"p","text":"rewards."},{"type":"p","text":"The documentation already treats weapon training and development as a separate part of progression."},{"type":"h2","text":"Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"At certain levels they require:"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"regional resources;"},{"type":"p","text":"currency."},{"type":"p","text":"This increases their maximum level cap."},{"type":"h2","text":"Refinement"},{"type":"p","text":"Duplicate copies of a weapon may improve its passive. However, I recommend limiting the impact."},{"type":"p","text":"We do not want:"},{"type":"p","text":"5★ weapon R1 = mediocre"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"p","text":"5★ weapon R5 = functional."},{"type":"p","text":"The weapon must be complete from its first copy."},{"type":"h1","text":"Artifacts"},{"type":"h2","text":"Level"},{"type":"p","text":"They are upgraded by sacrificing:"},{"type":"p","text":"specific materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"other Artifacts."},{"type":"p","text":"Leveling up improves:"},{"type":"p","text":"Main Stat;"},{"type":"p","text":"certain Secondary Stats."},{"type":"h1","text":"Cap"},{"type":"p","text":"I would not yet establish the definitive maximum level."},{"type":"p","text":"It may depend on rarity."},{"type":"p","text":"Example for prototype purposes only:"},{"type":"p","text":"3★ → Lv. 12"},{"type":"p","text":"4★ → Lv. 16"},{"type":"p","text":"5★ → Lv. 20"},{"type":"h1","text":"Sacrifice Mechanism"},{"type":"p","text":"This system comes directly from the historical project and deserves to be preserved as one of its distinctive features."},{"type":"p","text":"The original idea establishes that surplus Artifacts can be converted into investment points to increase the probability of obtaining certain characteristics in a new Artifact."},{"type":"p","text":"In addition, sacrificed materials must share:"},{"type":"p","text":"the same set;"},{"type":"p","text":"the same piece;"},{"type":"p","text":"a compatible rarity."},{"type":"h1","text":"5. Acquisition"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Equipment should come from different activities to connect this system with the Core Loop."},{"type":"h1","text":"Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"It may provide:"},{"type":"p","text":"common weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"Artifacts;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"relics;"},{"type":"p","text":"chests;"},{"type":"p","text":"regional equipment."},{"type":"p","text":"The original document specifically includes chests, items, and Artifacts as rewards from exploration and Dungeons."},{"type":"h1","text":"Crafting"},{"type":"p","text":"Primarily through:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Blacksmithing"},{"type":"p","text":"It may craft:"},{"type":"p","text":"weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"upgrades."},{"type":"p","text":"The later version even links Blacksmiths directly to weapon and progression systems."},{"type":"h1","text":"Bosses"},{"type":"h3","text":"Evolution Bosses"},{"type":"p","text":"Materials."},{"type":"h3","text":"Weekly Bosses"},{"type":"p","text":"Last Wills and advanced resources."},{"type":"p","text":"The historical source explicitly links Last Wills to Weekly Bosses."},{"type":"h1","text":"Dungeons"},{"type":"p","text":"They may specialize in:"},{"type":"p","text":"Artifacts;"},{"type":"p","text":"weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"talents;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"weekly Last Wills."},{"type":"h1","text":"Shops"},{"type":"p","text":"They may sell:"},{"type":"p","text":"3★ weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"some 4★ weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"regional equipment;"},{"type":"p","text":"recipes."},{"type":"p","text":"They should not permanently sell Best-in-Slot equipment for common currency."},{"type":"h1","text":"Events"},{"type":"p","text":"They may provide:"},{"type":"p","text":"themed 4★ weapon;"},{"type":"p","text":"Artifact;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"relic;"},{"type":"p","text":"cosmetic."},{"type":"h1","text":"Gacha"},{"type":"p","text":"The Gacha may include:"},{"type":"h3","text":"4★ and 5★ Weapons"},{"type":"p","text":"as already defined in the Gacha System."},{"type":"p","text":"I would not recommend introducing random Artifacts into the premium Gacha."},{"type":"p","text":"Equipment with random statistics should be obtained through gameplay."},{"type":"p","text":"This preserves: build = gameplay"},{"type":"p","text":"instead of: build = credit card + RNG."},{"type":"h1","text":"Last Wills"},{"type":"p","text":"They should not be in the Gacha either."},{"type":"p","text":"Their historical identity is related to:"},{"type":"p","text":"Bosses;"},{"type":"p","text":"ideologies;"},{"type":"p","text":"challenges;"},{"type":"p","text":"Dungeons."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, they should function as proof of gameplay mastery."},{"type":"h1","text":"Acquisition map"},{"type":"table","table":1},{"type":"h1","text":"6. Inventory UX Requirements"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Because the game may contain many characters, Artifacts, and materials, the inventory should be designed to reduce management rather than turn it into another Endgame activity."},{"type":"h1","text":"Main categories"},{"type":"p","text":"The inventory should separate:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Weapons"},{"type":"h3","text":"Artifacts"},{"type":"h3","text":"Last Wills"},{"type":"h3","text":"Consumables"},{"type":"h3","text":"Materials"},{"type":"h3","text":"Quest Items"},{"type":"h3","text":"Relics"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not use a single grid for everything."},{"type":"h1","text":"Filters"},{"type":"h2","text":"Weapons"},{"type":"p","text":"Filter by:"},{"type":"p","text":"family;"},{"type":"p","text":"rarity;"},{"type":"p","text":"level;"},{"type":"p","text":"statistic;"},{"type":"p","text":"equipped/unequipped;"},{"type":"p","text":"locked."},{"type":"h2","text":"Artifacts"},{"type":"p","text":"Filter by:"},{"type":"p","text":"set;"},{"type":"p","text":"slot;"},{"type":"p","text":"rarity;"},{"type":"p","text":"Main Stat;"},{"type":"p","text":"Secondary Stat;"},{"type":"p","text":"level;"},{"type":"p","text":"equipped;"},{"type":"p","text":"locked."},{"type":"p","text":"Especially important:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Search by desired stat"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Critical Rate + Energy Recharge"},{"type":"p","text":"The inventory displays compatible pieces."},{"type":"h1","text":"Sorting"},{"type":"p","text":"Allow sorting by:"},{"type":"p","text":"rarity;"},{"type":"p","text":"level;"},{"type":"p","text":"date;"},{"type":"p","text":"ATK;"},{"type":"p","text":"HP;"},{"type":"p","text":"DEF;"},{"type":"p","text":"Critical;"},{"type":"p","text":"Alchemy;"},{"type":"p","text":"set."},{"type":"h1","text":"Locking"},{"type":"p","text":"All equipment should allow:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Lock"},{"type":"p","text":"A locked item cannot:"},{"type":"p","text":"be used as EXP;"},{"type":"p","text":"be sacrificed;"},{"type":"p","text":"be dismantled."},{"type":"p","text":"Rare weapons/Artifacts should be locked automatically the first time they are obtained."},{"type":"h1","text":"Favorites"},{"type":"p","text":"There could be a:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Favorite"},{"type":"p","text":"separate from Lock."},{"type":"p","text":"Lock: protection."},{"type":"p","text":"Favorite: organization."},{"type":"h1","text":"Comparison"},{"type":"p","text":"When an item is selected, it should be possible to compare it immediately with the equipped item."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Current"},{"type":"p","text":"ATK +12.4 %"},{"type":"p","text":"Crit Rate +7 %"},{"type":"p","text":"↓"},{"type":"p","text":"New"},{"type":"p","text":"ATK +8 %"},{"type":"p","text":"Crit Rate +11 %"},{"type":"p","text":"Energy Recharge +6 %"},{"type":"p","text":"The UI should indicate:"},{"type":"p","text":"improvements;"},{"type":"p","text":"losses;"},{"type":"p","text":"Set Bonus changes."},{"type":"h1","text":"Equipment by character"},{"type":"p","text":"The character screen should show: what changes if I equip this piece"},{"type":"p","text":"without requiring constant switching between the inventory and character sheet."},{"type":"h1","text":"Loadouts"},{"type":"p","text":"I recommend including:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Equipment Presets"},{"type":"p","text":"The player may save several configurations."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Juro: Chaos DPS"},{"type":"p","text":"Juro: HP Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"This will be especially useful if characters can perform different roles."},{"type":"h1","text":"Shared equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"If a piece is already equipped by another character, show who is using it."},{"type":"p","text":"Before transferring: “Currently equipped by Hizuka.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The game may allow it to be swapped directly without opening another screen."},{"type":"h1","text":"Dismantling"},{"type":"p","text":"Surplus materials and equipment may be converted into:"},{"type":"p","text":"EXP;"},{"type":"p","text":"crafting material;"},{"type":"p","text":"limited currency."},{"type":"p","text":"But Artifacts have a second alternative:"},{"type":"h1","text":"Sacrifice"},{"type":"p","text":"The interface should clearly distinguish between:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Dismantle"},{"type":"p","text":"Destroy it to obtain resources."},{"type":"h3","text":"Sacrifice"},{"type":"p","text":"Invest the Artifact within the optimization system."},{"type":"p","text":"They should never be the same button."},{"type":"h1","text":"Multiple selection"},{"type":"p","text":"For large inventories:"},{"type":"p","text":"select multiple items;"},{"type":"p","text":"auto-select by rarity;"},{"type":"p","text":"exclude locked items;"},{"type":"p","text":"exclude equipped items;"},{"type":"p","text":"exclude favorites."},{"type":"h1","text":"Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"Before destroying a 5★ item:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Mandatory confirmation."},{"type":"p","text":"If it is:"},{"type":"p","text":"leveled;"},{"type":"p","text":"refined;"},{"type":"p","text":"equipped;"},{"type":"p","text":"rare;"},{"type":"p","text":"show an additional warning."},{"type":"h1","text":"Capacity"},{"type":"p","text":"I would not recommend an extremely low inventory limit."},{"type":"p","text":"Materials may use: a virtually unlimited stack."},{"type":"p","text":"The actual limit should mainly affect:"},{"type":"p","text":"weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"Artifacts;"},{"type":"p","text":"Last Wills."},{"type":"p","text":"And allow sufficient free expansion through progression."},{"type":"h1","text":"Recommended / Auto Equip"},{"type":"p","text":"There may be a function:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Recommended Build"},{"type":"p","text":"Especially because the Game Vision emphasizes experimenting with different compositions and styles."},{"type":"h1","text":"Salvage Preview"},{"type":"p","text":"Before confirming:"},{"type":"p","text":"You will receive:"},{"type":"p","text":"4 Enhancement Material"},{"type":"p","text":"2 Artifact Residue"},{"type":"p","text":"This prevents errors."}],"tables":[[["Status","DRAFT","Version","0.15.7"],["Owner","J. Crow","Last updated","08/20/2026"]],[["Category","Exploration","Crafting","Dungeon/Boss","Shop","Gacha"],["Weapons","✓","✓","✓","✓","✓"],["Artifacts","✓","Limited","✓","Limited","✗"],["Last Wills","✗/rare","✗","✓","✗","✗"],["Consumables","✓","✓","✓","✓","✗"],["Materials","✓","✓","✓","✓","✗"],["Relics","✓","Some","✓","Some","✗"]]]}